Iridium 1.0.24 - Client Bot Integration

🏪 New Features:
- Client Telegram Bot for sales & self-service
- Tariff management (traffic-based, time-based)
- Promo codes (discounts, free days, extra traffic)
- Payment via Telegram Stars & YooKassa
- Trial period support (configurable days/traffic)
- Customer management & statistics

📱 Web Panel:
- New "Shop" page with full management UI
- Tariffs & promos CRUD
- Customer list & payment stats
- Client bot start/stop/config

🖥️ CLI:
- `client-bot start/stop/restart/status`
- `tariff add/list/delete`
- `promo add/list/delete`
- `shop-stats` - revenue & customer stats

📋 Menu:
- "Client Bot (Sales)" in Advanced Settings
